WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:03.369
Connect your Neovim cursor to the page running in your browser.

00:03.819 --> 00:08.556
Start Neovim with the devhost launcher. Here, it runs off screen.

00:09.006 --> 00:12.396
Move the Neovim cursor to the heading. The page highlights it.

00:14.126 --> 00:17.191
Move the cursor again, and the highlight follows.

00:19.246 --> 00:23.379
Images work too. Source maps match the JSX to the page.

00:24.366 --> 00:26.781
Leave the JSX, and the highlight clears.
